     a bench sample could establish: one unit's mode with the bit set and with ChargeCurrent 0, pack absent and in S2: a deterministic logic behaviour, so one sample is strong evidence for that silicon revision
     a bench sample cannot establish: that no later revision changes the mode, nor how a temperature-dependent comparator moves it
