       sources into CELL+: the bleed was taken towards 0 V, as if no source fed the node. A source I lifts the level CELL+ falls towards to
       the foot plus I x R256, so t = R C ln((V0 - Vinf) / (Vdead - Vinf)), from VSYS's 17.375 V into CELL_FUSED's 104 uF at +20 % (ASSUMPTION):
