         6.8 kOhm, the sources at which the bleed takes the hold's least 1.341 s: 87.4 uA (V2: 88)
         6.8 kOhm, the same with U104's divider and R107 with R108 credited as loads: 121.3 uA (V2: 122)
         6.8 kOhm, the breaker pair at the 76.25 C air on L8P-F06 and the 1 MOhm, 86.6 uA: 1.339 s (V2: 1.339)
         6.8 kOhm, the same with the loads credited: 1.296 s (V2: 1.295)
         6.8 kOhm, the breaker pair at the held 101 C case and the 1 MOhm, 404.8 uA: 2.056 s (V2: 2.06)
         6.8 kOhm, the same with the loads credited: 1.947 s (V2: 1.95)
         4.7 kOhm, no source, towards the foot (round 10 printed 0.859 s towards 0 V): 0.866 s (V2: 0.866)
         4.7 kOhm, the sources at which the bleed takes 1.341 s: 520.7 uA (V2: 521)
         4.7 kOhm, the breaker pair at the held case and the 1 MOhm: 1.182 s (V2: 1.18)
     so the two limits of 21f could not both be used: with R256 at 6.8 kOhm the bleed ends inside the hold only while the sources total under
